<p class="lead">Movewise follows the federal Fair Housing Act and the fair housing laws of every state it serves.</p>
<p>Everyone sees the same homes and the same information. We don't describe neighbourhoods by who lives there, rate schools in ways that steer people, or suggest who a home "suits". AIlly, our assistant, follows the same rules.</p>
<p>When we show you agents, we use only the home, area, price, type of help and language you chose, never anything about you. Every set of agents shown is logged so it can be audited.</p>
<p>If you believe you've been treated unfairly, you can contact the U.S. Department of Housing and Urban Development at <a href="https://www.hud.gov/fairhousing">hud.gov/fairhousing</a> or call 1-800-669-9777, and tell us at the address on our <a href="/brokers">Brokers</a> page.</p>
<p class="eho">Equal Housing Opportunity.</p>
